  "summary": "Canton 参考文档：Details and history。",
  "body": "> 生成的 Ledger API gRPC 参考按包分组。\n\n<div class=\"x2mdx-ref-hero\">\n  <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-eyebrow\">gRPC API</p>\n\n  <h1 class=\"x2mdx-ref-title\">详细信息和历史记录</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-summary\">具有包级浏览和递归相关架构部分的操作优先 gRPC 页面。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n    <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">gRPC</span>\n\n    <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--neutral\">v3.5.1</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>来源</dt>\n      <dd>Canton Ledger API protobuf 发布包</dd>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>版本过滤器</dt>\n      <dd>稳定的 Canton 发行包 >= 3.4.4</dd>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>最新版本</dt>\n      <dd>v3.5.1</dd>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>包</dt>\n      <dd>5</dd>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>端点</dt>\n      <dd>58</dd>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>消息</dt>\n      <dd>237</dd>\n    </div>\n  </dl>\n</div>\n\n## 发布摘要\n\n计数显示为每个发布片段中添加/更改/删除的数量。\n\n<div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-grid\">\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>3.4.4</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--neutral\">发布</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">此版本的端点/消息/枚举增量。</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>端点</dt>\n        <dd>55/0/0</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>消息</dt>\n        <dd>227/0/0</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>枚举</dt>\n        <dd>12/0/0</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n    